       "text": "I entered the order as written (Order ID: ORD-0001): sertraline 400 mg by mouth once daily.\n\nThe order note says the dose is above the 200 mg/day labeled maximum and that you confirmed it. It also asks for pharmacy verification and monitoring for serotonin syndrome, QT prolongation, and bleeding.\n\nPharmacy may contact you to verify the dose. Consider a baseline ECG, a check of the patient's other medications for serotonergic or QT-prolonging interactions, and close monitoring after the order starts."
